    pk1:evidenceAgainst "2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py L1296–L1365: Retained Pass 2 measurements 1-4 built on the prescribed lookup readouts (AP/ML 4.25, speed 2.40, r = 1.0000, SU5402 1.00) — circular, non-evidence <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py#L1296-L1365>",
        "2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py L1399–L1411: Specimen PIV symmetry measurement with reference_value 0.9705 equal to the script's own output <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py#L1399-L1411>",
        "datasets/gastrulation_streak_attractor/ligand_emt_reference.json L117–L139: h0 ASSUMED; thickening ratio 1.33 and BM-broken fraction 0.08 DERIVED, not measured <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/datasets/gastrulation_streak_attractor/ligand_emt_reference.json#L117-L139>" ;
